' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' B2 片段: 展开 B1"固件升级模式"的内部子状态
' 被 b1_state_diagram.puml 在 state "固件升级模式" { } 内 !include
' 也可被 b2_state_diagram.puml !include 以 standalone 方式查看
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

state "USB断开模拟" as UsbDisc
state "LED快闪提示" as LedFlash
state "等待DFU烧录" as WaitDFU

[*] --> UsbDisc : 进入DFU
UsbDisc --> LedFlash : 断开完成
LedFlash --> WaitDFU : 提示完成
WaitDFU --> [*] : 复位重启
